 "name": "Wing King Imitation",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/blood-manipulation.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Piercing Blood</em></p>\n<p>You condense your blood into wings resembling veins as a bonus action for 10 CE, gathering the wings behind you and gaining the following benefits for 1 minute:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Your walking speed is quadrupled  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You gain a flying speed equal to half your walking speed  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>As a free action on your turn, you can unleash lines of blood. This takes shape as three ranged Cursed Energy attacks against a creature within 60 feet. Each attack deals 3d10 + your CE modifier in necrotic damage.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>While using Wing King, you cannot use <em>Piercing Blood</em>.</p>",
